---
---
<section id="hero" class="relative bg-[rgb(9,19,37)] overflow-hidden">
  <video
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0">
    <source src="/assets/video/hero-lightbulbs.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1]" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 19, 53, 0.75), rgba(0, 19, 53, 0.75));"></div>
  <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start min-h-[580px] max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 relative z-10">
    <h1 class="text-[44px] leading-[61.6px] font-bold font-serif text-white text-left max-w-[900px]">
      We Build Websites That Convert, Perform, and Dominate in the AI Search Era
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-white/90 mt-6 max-w-[700px]">
      Your website is more than a digital brochure – it's your 24/7 sales engine, brand authority builder, and the foundation of your AI search visibility. We create high-performance websites on Webflow and WordPress that deliver measurable business results.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
      <a href="/contact" class="bg-[rgb(58,166,196)] text-white rounded-[4px] px-6 py-3 text-[18px] font-normal hover:bg-[rgb(46,140,166)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center">
        Start Your Project
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
